Z||000019||Archie||08-24-2001||11:21 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mope:<BR><B>does this show bring alot of cars???<BR>I dont remember that parking lot being that big....<P>I'm sure i will be there with my car.<P>mope</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually that lot is a lot bigger than it looks.<P>We analized it again during the Fierorama last year and determined that it could hold at least 150+ cars (spaced out properly) for a show. Also there is a "Spill-over" show lot just behind the McD. next door.<P>Archie||||reg||1
